faqs.a:
The purposes of this Article is:
  1.	To set out the permitted, limited, conditional, and prohibited uses for primary uses in each zoning district;
  2.	To establish the use-specific standards that apply to limited and conditional land uses;
  3.	To establish standards for certain temporary uses;
  4.	To establish standards for the business use of the home;
  5.	To establish standards applicable to oil and gas operations.
